  "description": "Octéo is an above-ground automatic slatted cover. The roller sits on the pool deck between two sculpted cast-aluminium legs that house the 24 V motor, and the cover glides over the water at the turn of a key or from your phone. It keeps the pool clean, reduces heat loss and evaporation, and secures the pool to the French NF P90-308 safety standard. Choose from four leg finishes and four slat colours, with optional solar-powered LED lighting in both legs.",
